sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor S as Student
  participant UI as GPA page
  participant API as Express API
  participant GS as GpaService
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  S->>UI: enter target CGPA and remaining credit hours
  UI->>API: POST /gpa/target (Bearer JWT)
  API->>DB: SELECT grades JOIN courses WHERE student_id
  DB-->>API: credit hours and grade points
  API->>GS: computeGpa(grades)
  GS-->>API: completed credits C, quality points Q
  API->>GS: targetRequirement(C, Q, R, target)
  alt required average above scale maximum
    GS-->>API: feasible=false, best achievable CGPA
  else reachable
    GS-->>API: required average, formula, working
  end
  API-->>UI: 200 result
  UI->>S: message + formula + worked calculation
